{"id": "03", "model": "eleven_v4", "lines": [{"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "That evening, the living room turned into a gaming setup. [pause] Kind of."}, {"speaker": "DAD", "text": "[squinting] Okay. Username. [pause] D... A... D... [pause] Where's the B?"}, {"speaker": "YOU", "text": "[impatient] Dad, it's RIGHT there!"}, {"speaker": "DAD", "text": "[proud] Got it! \"DadBod nineteen seventy-eight.\""}, {"speaker": "YOU", "text": "[groans] Why would you tell everyone your age?!"}, {"speaker": "DAD", "text": "[proudly] And for the password... [pause] \"password.\""}, {"speaker": "YOU", "text": "[facepalm] Dad. NO."}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "Then Dad went to the avatar shop. [pause] And he clicked... everything."}, {"speaker": "DAD", "text": "[confused] Son... why am I a hot dog?"}, {"speaker": "YOU", "text": "[deadpan] I don't know, Dad. You did that."}, {"speaker": "DAD", "text": "[warming up] You know what? [pause] I like it. I'm keeping it."}, {"speaker": "MOM", "text": "[calm] I'm not really a gamer, sweetie. [pause] I'll just watch."}, {"speaker": "YOU", "text": "[confused] Mom... you're completely grey."}, {"speaker": "MOM", "text": "[calm] Grey is classy, sweetie."}, {"speaker": "GRANDMA", "text": "[loudly, into the phone] HELLO, PHONE. [pause] MAKE ME. A GAME. PERSON."}, {"speaker": "GRANDMA", "text": "[confused] Which button is \"go\"? [pause] Oh! I bought something."}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "Granny pressed buttons at random... and somehow ended up looking like a billionaire."}, {"speaker": "YOU", "text": "[defeated] Okay. Rule number one. [pause] Do NOT talk to my friends."}, {"speaker": "DAD", "text": "[cheerfully] Got it, champ!"}], "voice_segments": [{"voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb", "start_time_seconds": 0.0, "end_time_seconds": 5.0, "character_start_index": 0, "character_end_index": 74, "dialogue_input_index": 0}, {"voice_id": "cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal", "start_time_seconds": 5.0, "end_time_seconds": 13.280000000000001, "character_s